# Way to Excellence - Rails 8 Development Standards

## Project Context

Quality management standards compliance platform built with Rails 8 (full MVC).
**Current Phase:** Milestone 1, Week 1 - Standards Ingestion & Curation

## Architecture Guidelines

### Rails 8 MVC Structure

- Follow Rails conventions strictly (CoC over configuration)
- Use Hotwire (Turbo + Stimulus) for interactivity
- Use Sidekiq for background jobs
- PostgreSQL for database with proper indexing
- Use tailwind

### Code Organization

- **Models:** Slim models, business logic in service objects
- **Controllers:** RESTful actions, delegate complex logic to services
- **Views:** Use view components for reusable UI elements
- **Services:** `app/services/` for business logic (StandardIngestionService, ClauseTreeBuilder)
- **Jobs:** `app/jobs/` for async processing (PdfParsingJob, ClauseTreeGenerationJob)
